[ti:Day 02]

[00:00.00]implicit 例 In our work, we judge using the implicit models our intuition provides. 在工作中，我们 通过直觉提供的隐式模型来进行判断。
[00:09.54]hasty 例 Faced with emergency, some people are prone to jump to hasty conclusions. 遇到紧急 情况，有些人往往急于作出轻率的结论。
[00:18.95]helm 例 Apple's executive team hoped the first device sold without their visionary leader at the helm would protect them against a growing challenge from the likes of Samsung Electronics. 苹果公司的管理团队希望，这款首个 在没有乔布斯掌舵情况下推出的产品能够使其免 受来自三星公司同类产品日益严峻的挑战。
[00:40.66]mind-boggling 例 He created mind-boggling effects with his computer. 他用电脑制造出令人难以置信的效 果。
[00:48.82]inelastic 例 Our clients have an inelastic demand for products. 我们的客户对产品的需求缺乏弹性。
[00:56.15]supervise 例 The investment data of foreign capital enterprises are checked and supervised by the industrial and commercial administration management sectors. 外资企业的投资数据由工
[01:15.10]gravitate 例 Both beginners and experts tend over time to gravitate towards intermediates. 随着时间推 移，新手和专家都会被中间用户所吸引。
[01:25.76]conflict 例 The conflict between management and workers makes for inefficiency in the workplace. 管理层与工人之间的冲突使得工厂生 产效率很低。
[01:37.10]exaggerate 例 Tell your manager the exact difficulties of your work, neither exaggerate nor conceal. 向 经理说明工作困难时要实事求是，既别夸大，也 别隐瞒。
[01:48.85]chip 例 The stock will move further up as functionality starts to consolidate from the board to the chip. 随着功能开始从主板向芯片整 合，这只股票还会进一步上扬。
[02:00.75]foregone 例 The election result is not a foregone conclusion. 选举的结果尚无定论。
[02:07.80]camcorder 例 All of the camcorder's main components come in pairs: two lenses, two image sensors and two image processors. 这款便携式摄像机 中的所有主要元件都是成对的：两个镜头、两个 影像感测器和两个影像处理器。
[02:21.91]hunter 例 Prior to the purchase decision, the hunter has a thorough understanding of specific needs and the issues affecting the decision- making. 在决定购买之前，这位搜寻者对具体需 求以及影响购买决定的问题就已经有了透彻的了 解。
[02:38.93]cancellation 例 The cancellation of the summit marks an escalation in tensions between America and some European countries. 取消峰会意味着美国 与部分欧洲国家的紧张关系在持续恶化。
[02:53.45]bug 例 Your job is to have the seriousness of the bug accurately assessed. 你的工作是精确评估 故障的严重性。
[03:01.75]original 例 The statue is a reproduction, not the original. 这座雕塑是件复制品，不是原作。
[03:08.53]benchmark 例 Now the region's benchmark index has plunged to its lowest level in over the last two years. 现在，该地区的基准指数已跌至近两年的 最低水平。
[03:20.42]accumulate 例 Most countries have accumulated an impressive stock of hard-currency reserves. 大多数国家都积累了相当可观的硬通货储备。
[03:31.49]costing 例 It provides a new method to improve traditional costing accounting by cost driver analysis. 通过成本动因分析，它为改进传统的成 本核算方式提供了一种全新的方法。
[03:43.39]amenity 例 Nap rooms have become a more commonplace amenity for companies looking to bill themselves as fun, dynamic places to work. 对于希望对外宣扬充满趣味和活力的公司
[03:58.60]core 例 Management of succession must be at the core of how you manage the company. 你必须 把继任管理工作放在如何管理公司的核心位置。
[04:07.87]distinguish 例 Manufactures are striving to distinguish their products in terms of quality, unit price and added-value features. 制造商们竭力使产品 在质量、单价和附加值特征方面卓尔不群。
[04:23.08]factual 例 Securities trading information disseminated by all media must be factual and objective and not misleading. 所有传播媒介传播的证券交易信 息必须真实、客观、无误导性。
[04:36.92]infringe 例 The measures that the government has taken may infringe on privacy and civil liberties. 政府采取的措施可能会侵犯个人隐私和 公民自由。
[04:48.40]virtue 例 By virtue of being a multinational enterprise for a decade, the company has accumulated $9.2 billion in corporate assets. 作为一家成立 十年的跨国企业，该公司已积累了92亿美元的企 业资产。
[05:03.61]toss 例 My little brother and I often toss to see who pays the bill. 我跟弟弟两人经常掷钱币决定 由谁付账。
[05:10.94]ascertain 例 We must ascertain the responsibility in light of different situations. 我们必须根据不同情况判 定责任。
[05:20.76]defray 例 Most transportation companies announced fare increases to defray increases in fuel prices. 大多数运输公司宣布提高票价以支付油价 上涨的费用。
[05:32.66]announce 例 We expect to announce more partnerships in the near future. 我期望不久的将来可以宣布成 立更多的合股公司。
[05:40.82]patronise 例 Unlike other colleagues in the company, he does not patronise newbies. 他与公司的其他同 事不同，从不盛气凌人地对待新员工。
[05:50.50]skyrocket 例 Many citizens worry prices will continue to skyrocket. 许多市民担心物价会继续猛涨。
[05:58.39]climax 例 With the opening of the exhibition, various products are beginning to reach the sales climax. 随着展会的开幕，各种产品都将达到销售 高峰。
[06:10.28]hammer 例 All of the staff in the company are working hammer and tongs to raise productivity. 公司 全体员工都在竭尽全力地提高生产率。
[06:20.80]jobbing 例 Our customers are globally located, ranging from multinationals to small jobbing centres. 我们的客户遍及全球，有跨国公司也有小型加工 中心。
[06:32.69]galaxy 例 Astronomers have detected a planet at least the size of Jupiter and they believe it is in another galaxy. 天文学家们发现了一颗行星， 至少跟木星一样大小。他们相信这颗行星来自其 他星系。
[06:45.69]achievement 例 The achievement of her purpose mainly depends on her perseverance. 她的目标的实现 主要依靠她的毅力。
[06:55.24]ideology 例 His biggest weakness has to do with ideology rather than age. 他最大的弱点不在年 龄，而在思维方式。
[07:03.54]modest 例 There is a modest improvement in housing conditions for the company's employees. 该公 司员工的住宿条件得到了适当改善。
[07:14.05]compliment 例 After the party, you should compliment the host to show your gratitude. 晚宴结束后，你应 该赞美邀请你来的主人以表达谢意。
[07:23.87]unchecked 例 China's economic situation is set to become dangerous if its house prices continue to rise unchecked. 如果房价持续不受 控制地上涨的话，中国的经济形势势必会变得很 危险。
[07:37.15]stockpile 例 The present stockpile of unsold houses will be enough for millions of citizens. 目前的待售 房屋量足够数百万市民居住。
[07:47.80]arrangement 例 He has made every arrangement to meet any emergency. 他已作好了应急的一切准备。
[07:55.55]fiduciary 例 The risks in these deals are so uncontrollable that if a deal went wrong, the PE firm would be vulnerable to a lawsuit by its partners for breach of fiduciary duty. 这类交易 的风险非常难以控制，如果一项交易出了差错， 则经手的私募股权投资公司很可能会因违反受托 人义务而被合伙人告上法庭。
[08:15.46]mat 例 The hi-tech product is a mat made of an electronic screen. 这个高科技产品是一个由电子 屏幕做成的垫子。
[08:22.66]approve 例 To achieve all this, the national governments must approve some 300 directives. 要达到这些，各成员国政府必须批准 大约300项指令。
[08:33.17]inject 例 Reform of this system would inject more vitality into the Chinese economy. 这项制度的 改革会给中国的经济注入更多的活力。
[08:42.85]trundle 例 The negotiation has been trundling on for weeks and there's still no end in sight. 此次谈 判已持续数周，至今仍没有结束的迹象。
[08:53.36]apprehend 例 The police investigate a crime and may apprehend suspects and detain them in custody. 警方调查犯罪，并可以逮捕和羁押犯罪 嫌疑人。
[09:04.71]cross 例 Write the number next to the item name, and cross it off your work list. 在商品名的旁边
[09:13.56]rapport 例 It is necessary to nurture emotional rapport between your brand and its followers. 有必要 在品牌和其追随者之间建立情感上的密切关系。
[09:24.35]rapprochement 例 There is no obvious sign of rapprochement between the two countries. 还没有明显迹象表 明两国要恢复邦交。
[09:34.31]humiliate 例 There is no reason for you to humiliate our former competitors and present friends. 你不 应该羞辱我们之前的竞争对手和现在的朋友。
[09:45.37]ballyhoo 例 The advertisement specially designed for the company's new products was attended with too much ballyhoo. 为该公司的新产品专门 设计的广告宣传得太过夸张。
[09:59.07]evolution 例 The manager is struggling between evolution and revolution in our department. 我 们部门要缓慢发展还是进行改革，经理正在这两 者间艰难地作着抉择。
[10:09.72]exile 例 A person who is sent into exile is always someone who has different political ideas. 被 流放者往往有着不同的政治观点。
[10:20.23]redirect 例 Please redirect our mail to the new address. 请将我们的邮件改寄到新地址。
